Example: time-weight the actual changing portfolio, excluding external flows.
Only Assets:Investments is selected; Assets:Cash is outside this report.
With no --include-commodities option, the report discovers EQUITY and BOND from the
selected accounts.
EQUITY rises from 100 to 300 USD (+200%) over the year, while BOND falls from
100 to 60 USD (-40%). In January, 200 USD buys one of each at 100 USD.
By March, EQUITY is 120 and BOND is 80: their combined
value is still 200. A 120 USD bonus buys another EQUITY, raising the selected
value to 320 without creating a 60% investment return that day.
In May, prices are 160 and 80. Selling one EQUITY for 160 and buying two BOND
units for 160 changes the holdings from two EQUITY and one BOND to one EQUITY
and three BOND. Both sides of this reallocation are selected, so its net
external flow is zero and the value remains 400.
In August, EQUITY is 200 and BOND is 50. All units are sold for 350 USD; the
cash stays in an account outside this report. Selected value is zero through
September. In October, only 300 USD is reinvested: one EQUITY at 250 and one
BOND at 50. The remaining 50 USD stays outside the selection in Assets:Cash.
At year-end, EQUITY is 300 and BOND is 60, so selected value is 360.

For each date below, V is the selected closing value and F is its signed
external flow. Ledlight assumes flows occur at the end of their posting day:
  Jan 01: V = 200, F = +200, first funded factor = 200 / 200 = 1.00
  Mar 01: V = 320, F = +120, factor = (320 - 120) / 200 = 1.00
  May 01: V = 400, F =    0, factor = 400 / 320 = 1.25
  Aug 01: V =   0, F = -350, factor = (0 - (-350)) / 400 = 0.875
  Oct 01: V = 300, F = +300, restart factor = 300 / 300 = 1.00
  Dec 31: V = 360, F =    0, factor = 360 / 300 = 1.20
The zero-value days between August and October contribute no market return.
Compounding the factors gives 1.00 * 1.00 * 1.25 * 0.875 * 1.00 * 1.20 - 1
= 31.25% time-weighted return. Net contributions are 200 + 120 - 350 + 300
= 270 USD, while profit/loss is ending value 360 - contributions 270 = 90.
Annualizing the 31.25% over January 1 to December 31 (364 days), including
the zero-value interval, gives 31.35%.
Simply dividing profit by net contributions gives 90 / 270 = 33.33%, which
is neither return measure. For money-weighting, the investor's dated flows
are -200, -120, +350, -300, and the final +360 USD valuation. Those amounts
and dates give 38.88% total and 39.01% annualized return.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight investment-performance --accounts '^Assets:Investments:' --from 2023-01-01 --to 2023-12-31 --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity EQUITY
  format 1,000 EQUITY
commodity BOND
  format 1,000 BOND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Investments:Equity
account Assets:Investments:Bonds
account Income:Salary
account Income:Bonus
account Income:Gains
account Expenses:Losses
P 2023-01-01 EQUITY 100 USD
P 2023-01-01 BOND 100 USD
P 2023-03-01 EQUITY 120 USD
P 2023-03-01 BOND 80 USD
P 2023-05-01 EQUITY 160 USD
P 2023-05-01 BOND 80 USD
P 2023-08-01 EQUITY 200 USD
P 2023-08-01 BOND 50 USD
P 2023-10-01 EQUITY 250 USD
P 2023-10-01 BOND 50 USD
P 2023-12-31 EQUITY 300 USD
P 2023-12-31 BOND 60 USD

2023-01-01 Salary
  Assets:Cash  200 USD
  Income:Salary  -200 USD

2023-01-01 Initial investment
  Assets:Investments:Equity  1 EQUITY {100 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Bonds  1 BOND {100 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -200 USD

2023-03-01 Bonus
  Assets:Cash  120 USD
  Income:Bonus  -120 USD

2023-03-01 Invest bonus
  Assets:Investments:Equity  1 EQUITY {120 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -120 USD

2023-05-01 Sell one equity unit
  Assets:Investments:Equity  -1 EQUITY {100 USD} @ 160 USD
  Assets:Cash  160 USD
  Income:Gains  -60 USD

2023-05-01 Reallocate into bonds
  Assets:Investments:Bonds  2 BOND {80 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -160 USD

2023-08-01 Sell remaining equity
  Assets:Investments:Equity  -1 EQUITY {120 USD} @ 200 USD
  Assets:Cash  200 USD
  Income:Gains  -80 USD

2023-08-01 Sell all bonds
  Assets:Investments:Bonds  -1 BOND {100 USD} @ 50 USD
  Assets:Investments:Bonds  -2 BOND {80 USD} @ 50 USD
  Assets:Cash  150 USD
  Expenses:Losses  110 USD

2023-10-01 Reenter both markets
  Assets:Investments:Equity  1 EQUITY {250 USD}
  Assets:Investments:Bonds  1 BOND {50 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -300 USD

